  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Spread nduja on four slices of pita bread, leaving a 1/2 inch border around the edges.",
    "Top with capers, parsley, garlic, olive oil, lemon juice, salt, black pepper, and red pepper flakes.",
    "Grill the sandwiches for 2-3 minutes per side, or until the bread is toasted and the filling is heated through.",
    "Meanwhile, grill the zucchini and red onion slices for 2-3 minutes per side, or until tender.",
    "Cut the grilled zucchini and red onion into strips.",
    "Assemble the sandwiches by placing a few strips of grilled zucchini and red onion on top of the filling.",
    "Divide the sandwiches among four bento boxes and serve immediately.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley and lemon wedges, if desired."
  ],
